1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Mark 13

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:07,080
And as he came out of the temple, one of his disciples said to him,

3
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:11,620
Look, teacher, what wonderful stones and what wonderful buildings!

4
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:13,800
And Jesus said to him,

5
00:00:14,460 --> 00:00:16,180
Do you see these great buildings?

6
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:21,940
There will not be left here one stone upon another that will not be thrown down.

7
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:25,620
And as he sat on the Mount of Olives opposite the temple,

8
00:00:26,180 --> 00:00:29,300
Peter and James and John and Andrew asked him privately,

9
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,940
Tell us, when will these things be?

10
00:00:33,620 --> 00:00:37,380
And what will be the sign when all these things are about to be accomplished?

11
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:40,260
And Jesus began to say to them,

12
00:00:40,980 --> 00:00:42,760
See that no one leads you astray.

13
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:45,860
Many will come in my name, saying, I am he.

14
00:00:46,240 --> 00:00:47,800
And they will lead many astray.

15
00:00:48,420 --> 00:00:50,780
And when you hear of wars and rumors of wars,

16
00:00:50,780 --> 00:00:52,260
do not be alarmed.

17
00:00:52,720 --> 00:00:55,160
This must take place, but the end is not yet.

18
00:00:56,420 --> 00:00:58,440
For nation will rise against nation,

19
00:00:58,700 --> 00:00:59,780
and kingdom against kingdom,

20
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:02,940
there will be earthquakes in various places,

21
00:01:03,380 --> 00:01:04,360
there will be famines.

22
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:07,660
These are but the beginning of the birth pains.

23
00:01:08,980 --> 00:01:10,340
But be on your guard,

24
00:01:10,660 --> 00:01:12,520
for they will deliver you over to councils,

25
00:01:12,900 --> 00:01:14,920
and you will be beaten in synagogues,

26
00:01:15,060 --> 00:01:19,560
and you will stand before governors and kings for my sake to bear witness before them.

27
00:01:20,320 --> 00:01:23,780
And the gospel must first be proclaimed to all nations.

28
00:01:24,680 --> 00:01:27,580
And when they bring you to trial and deliver you over,

29
00:01:27,580 --> 00:01:29,480
do not be anxious beforehand.

30
00:01:29,640 --> 00:01:29,980
What you are saying,

31
00:01:29,980 --> 00:01:33,180
but say whatever is given you in that hour.

32
00:01:33,620 --> 00:01:35,240
For it is not you who speak,

33
00:01:35,440 --> 00:01:36,500
but the Holy Spirit.

34
00:01:37,840 --> 00:01:40,700
And brother will deliver brother over to death,

35
00:01:41,020 --> 00:01:42,520
and the father his child.

36
00:01:42,980 --> 00:01:46,220
And children will rise against parents and have them put to death.

37
00:01:46,820 --> 00:01:50,720
And you will be hated by all for my name's sake.

38
00:01:51,140 --> 00:01:54,480
But the one who endures to the end will be saved.

39
00:01:55,580 --> 00:01:59,320
But when you see the abomination of desolation

40
00:01:59,320 --> 00:01:59,960
standing before you,

41
00:01:59,960 --> 00:02:03,120
let the reader understand.

42
00:02:03,920 --> 00:02:06,860
Then let those who are in Judea flee to the mountains.

43
00:02:07,540 --> 00:02:10,180
Let the one who is on the housetop not go down,

44
00:02:10,420 --> 00:02:12,700
nor enter his house to take anything out.

45
00:02:13,020 --> 00:02:16,600
And let the one who is in the field not turn back to take his cloak.

46
00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:20,100
And alas for women who are pregnant

47
00:02:20,100 --> 00:02:23,040
and for those who are nursing infants in those days.

48
00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:25,600
Pray that it may not happen in winter.

49
00:02:26,600 --> 00:02:29,440
For in those days there will be such tribulation.

50
00:02:29,960 --> 00:02:33,500
As has not been from the beginning of the creation that God created

51
00:02:33,500 --> 00:02:36,540
until now and never will be.

52
00:02:37,520 --> 00:02:40,120
And if the Lord had not cut short the days,

53
00:02:40,460 --> 00:02:42,140
no human being would be saved.

54
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:44,780
But for the sake of the elect whom he chose,

55
00:02:44,900 --> 00:02:46,000
he shortened the days.

56
00:02:46,780 --> 00:02:48,640
And then if anyone says to you,

57
00:02:48,980 --> 00:02:50,600
Look, here is the Christ,

58
00:02:50,860 --> 00:02:52,200
or look, there he is,

59
00:02:52,640 --> 00:02:53,740
do not believe it.

60
00:02:53,740 --> 00:02:57,200
For false Christs and false prophets will arise

61
00:02:57,200 --> 00:02:58,720
and perform signs and wonders

62
00:02:58,720 --> 00:02:59,740
to lead astray,

63
00:02:59,960 --> 00:03:01,420
if possible, the elect.

64
00:03:01,980 --> 00:03:03,400
But be on guard.

65
00:03:03,660 --> 00:03:05,740
I have told you all things beforehand.

66
00:03:06,840 --> 00:03:08,320
But in those days,

67
00:03:08,620 --> 00:03:09,900
after that tribulation,

68
00:03:10,300 --> 00:03:11,720
the sun will be darkened,

69
00:03:11,940 --> 00:03:13,620
and the moon will not give its light,

70
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:15,980
and the stars will be falling from heaven,

71
00:03:16,080 --> 00:03:18,160
and the powers in the heavens will be shaken.

72
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:21,100
And then they will see the Son of Man

73
00:03:21,100 --> 00:03:24,020
coming in clouds with great power and glory.

74
00:03:24,500 --> 00:03:26,880
And then he will send out the angels

75
00:03:26,880 --> 00:03:29,080
and gather his elect from the four winds,

76
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:29,940
from the ends of the earth,

77
00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:32,000
to the ends of heaven.

78
00:03:33,200 --> 00:03:36,020
From the fig tree, learn its lesson.

79
00:03:36,580 --> 00:03:38,520
As soon as its branch becomes tender

80
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:39,640
and puts out its leaves,

81
00:03:40,020 --> 00:03:41,620
you know that summer is near.

82
00:03:42,160 --> 00:03:45,600
So also, when you see these things taking place,

83
00:03:45,940 --> 00:03:47,480
you know that he is near,

84
00:03:47,720 --> 00:03:48,860
at the very gates.

85
00:03:49,800 --> 00:03:51,220
Truly I say to you,

86
00:03:51,480 --> 00:03:53,460
this generation will not pass away

87
00:03:53,460 --> 00:03:55,400
until all these things take place.

88
00:03:55,920 --> 00:03:57,540
Heaven and earth will pass away,

89
00:03:57,540 --> 00:03:59,920
but my words will not pass away.

90
00:03:59,940 --> 00:04:03,480
But concerning that day or that hour,

91
00:04:03,940 --> 00:04:04,760
no one knows,

92
00:04:05,040 --> 00:04:06,560
not even the angels in heaven,

93
00:04:06,880 --> 00:04:07,760
nor the Son,

94
00:04:08,160 --> 00:04:09,480
but only the Father.

95
00:04:10,620 --> 00:04:12,840
Be on guard, keep awake,

96
00:04:13,220 --> 00:04:15,400
for you do not know when the time will come.

97
00:04:16,420 --> 00:04:18,440
It is like a man going on a journey,

98
00:04:18,760 --> 00:04:21,240
when he leaves home and puts his servants in charge,

99
00:04:21,540 --> 00:04:22,480
each with his work,

100
00:04:22,660 --> 00:04:25,120
and commands the doorkeeper to stay awake.

101
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:27,940
Therefore stay awake,

102
00:04:27,940 --> 00:04:29,440
for you do not know

103
00:04:29,440 --> 00:04:31,120
when the master of the house will come,

104
00:04:31,500 --> 00:04:33,160
in the evening, or at midnight,

105
00:04:33,280 --> 00:04:34,460
or when the rooster crows,

106
00:04:34,560 --> 00:04:35,400
or in the morning,

107
00:04:36,180 --> 00:04:38,900
lest he come suddenly and find you asleep.

108
00:04:39,260 --> 00:04:41,460
And what I say to you I say to all,

109
00:04:41,460 --> 00:04:43,220
stay awake.

